#: ../../source/module/faces_calculator3.rst:2
msgid "Faces Calculator3 Module"
msgstr "Faces Calculator3 模块"

#: ../../source/module/faces_calculator3.rst:8
msgid ""
"Faces Calculator3 is a calculator keypad module. It reports released key "
"codes through a callback and uses I2C address ``0x08`` by default."
msgstr ""
"Faces Calculator3 是一个计算器键盘模块。它通过回调报告释放的按键编码，"
"默认使用 I2C 地址 ``0x08``。"

