msgstr "UiFlow2 应用示例"

#: ../../source/module/faces_calculator3.rst:19
#: ../../source/module/faces_calculator3.rst:32
msgid "Key event display"
msgstr "按键事件显示"

#: ../../source/module/faces_calculator3.rst:21
msgid ""
"This example reports the key released on the CoreS3 display. The callback"
" receives the released key code, converts it to a character, and displays"
" it."
msgstr ""
"该示例在 CoreS3 显示屏上报告释放的按键。回调函数会收到释放的按键编码，"
"将其转换为字符并显示。"

#: ../../source/module/faces_calculator3.rst:26
msgid "Open the |faces_calculator3_cores3_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |faces_calculator3_cores3_example.m5f2| 项目。"

#: ../../source/module/faces_calculator3.rst:29
msgid "MicroPython Example"
msgstr "MicroPython 应用示例"

#: ../../source/module/faces_calculator3.rst:34
msgid ""
"Call :meth:`FacesCalculator3Module.tick` regularly from the main loop to "
"poll for new key events."
msgstr "在主循环中定期调用 :meth:`FacesCalculator3Module.tick`，轮询新的按键事件。"

